# Build context for adapters/gateway/Dockerfile (the repo root). That Dockerfile
# copies only pyproject.toml, README.md, LICENSE, requirements/gateway.txt and
# src/, so everything else is kept out of the context. The context is sent to
# the builder whether or not a COPY names a file, and deploy/openwebui/.env
# holds real keys. An allowlist, so a new file is excluded until someone adds it.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!requirements/gateway.txt
!src/

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
